1
00:00:00,812 --> 00:00:03,692
(Sheldon:)- By lying to them?
- How is this lying?

2
00:00:03,899 --> 00:00:06,689
(Sheldon:)A magic show is an inherently
deceitful proposition.

3
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:11,070
"This is an ordinary top hat."
"You've chosen that card freely."

4
00:00:11,239 --> 00:00:14,579
"l do not have a set
of lock picks lodged in my keister."

5
00:00:15,619 --> 00:00:17,449
Can't you just enjoy the wonder?

6
00:00:17,621 --> 00:00:20,751
(Raj:)Why must you peek
behind the curtain, or up the butt?

7
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,710
(Sheldon:)If we poison the critical thinking
facuIties of children...

8
00:00:24,878 --> 00:00:27,088
(Sheldon:)...by telling them
rabbits come out of hats...

9
00:00:27,255 --> 00:00:31,175
...then we create aduIts who believe
in astrology and homeopathy...

10
00:00:31,343 --> 00:00:34,343
...and Ryan Reynolds was a
better choice for Green Lantern...

11
00:00:34,513 --> 00:00:36,473
(Sheldon:)...than lovable rogue Nathan Fillion.

12
00:00:38,683 --> 00:00:41,223
(Leonard:)He's just gonna do
a few magic tricks for some kids.

13
00:00:41,394 --> 00:00:45,064
(Leonard:)I really don't think they're gonna
end up liking the Green Lantern movie.

14
00:00:45,273 --> 00:00:49,613
(Howard:)Don't be so hard on him, it's natural
to be a little cranky when you have...

15
00:00:49,778 --> 00:00:51,658
(Howard:)...a quarter in your ear.

16
00:00:54,074 --> 00:00:57,204
(Sheldon:)Coins lodged in body parts
is not a source of amusement.

17
00:00:57,369 --> 00:01:00,829
(Sheldon:)When I was five, Billy Sparks
put a Mexican peso up my nose.

18
00:01:03,583 --> 00:01:06,503
- How is that not amusing?
- It's still there.

19
00:01:09,005 --> 00:01:12,215
It takes me 45 minutes
to get through airport security.

20
00:01:15,137 --> 00:01:17,597
(Howard:)Look. I made Sheldon disappear.
Ta-da!

21
00:01:18,598 --> 00:01:21,138
(Leonard:)Next time you should open with that.

